WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,320
Jiaojiao is just a child

2
00:00:01,320 --> 00:00:02,640
How can I expect so much?

3
00:00:03,200 --> 00:00:06,520
She has been innocent and kind since she was a child, but Qiao is not as sensible as you.

4
00:00:06,520 --> 00:00:11,730
It always makes me feel my endless heart without feeling it

5
00:00:11,930 --> 00:00:12,970
Just scolding Youyou

6
00:00:13,290 --> 00:00:14,740
Pain meibao

7
00:00:14,900 --> 00:00:16,820
I'll give you a quick hug and I'll kill you

8
00:00:17,060 --> 00:00:18,180
This is the end of the story

9
00:00:18,540 --> 00:00:21,390
From now on, no one will mention Jiaojiao again.

10
00:00:21,870 --> 00:00:23,430
Grandpa invites Chef Mi Jiling for dinner

11
00:00:23,430 --> 00:00:25,310
How about cooking your favorite meal?

12
00:00:27,910 --> 00:00:29,390
She'll be fine

13
00:00:32,550 --> 00:00:34,150
Handle it so gently

14
00:00:35,640 --> 00:00:37,440
It’s not like the style of grandparents

15
00:00:37,560 --> 00:00:40,440
It's a good thing that you're in a hurry

16
00:00:40,720 --> 00:00:43,670
Youyou is not that thoughtful, or else

17
00:00:44,230 --> 00:00:48,270
I'm afraid the little nanny is about to change into a little aunt. You guys, get your tools ready.

18
00:00:48,550 --> 00:00:57,670
It’s Brother Hong who’s going to catch all the stray animals nearby.

19
00:00:57,990 --> 00:00:59,630
Don't talk about stray animals around here.

20
00:00:59,870 --> 00:01:03,660
There's not even a single mosquito. It's such a small thing.

21
00:01:03,860 --> 00:01:08,290
How could this happen if I have to take action myself?

22
00:01:08,530 --> 00:01:10,620
If you report the news back to Mr. Pei,

23
00:01:10,780 --> 00:01:13,460
I'm afraid they'll just blame me for not being able to continue searching for a while.

24
00:01:14,070 --> 00:01:16,310
Even if it is three feet away, we must find it
